  "question": {
    "text": "A wire of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> moving with velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> at right angles to a magnetic field of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math>. The magnitude of induced emf, between the ends of wire will be ___________."
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0056_9bbabd51e81f.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 238px;\" /></p><p>The expression of motional emf is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math>, where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi></math>&nbsp;is angle between magnetic field and direction of motion.</p><p>Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>,&nbsp;</p><p>So, induced emf across the ends of wire is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>v</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p>"
  }
}